<sect2 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_DCC_EX3_CONTINUOUS_MONITORING_OF_CLOCK_1autotoc_md182">
<title>Calculations</title>
<para><verbatim>  Since Fclk1&gt;Fclk0, Async. Error (In Clock0 cycles) = 2 + 2*(Fsysclk/Fclk0) = 42

  Digitization error (In Clock0 cycles) = 8

  DCC Error = Async. Error + Digitization error = 50

  Window (in Cycles) = (DCC Error) / (0.01 * Tolerance)

  Window = 50 / (0.01 * 1) = 5000

  Frequency Error Allowed  (In Clock0 Cycles)
                        =  Window * (Allowable Frequency Tolerance (in %) / 100)
                        =  5000 * (1.5/100) = 75

  Total Error = DCC Error + Frequency Error Allowed  = 50 + 150 = 200

  Counter0 = Window - Total Error  = 5000 - 125 = 4875

  Valid0   = 2 * Total Error  = 2 * 125 = 250

  Counter1 = Window x (Fclk1/Fclk0) = 5000 * (160/8)  = 100000
</verbatim> <simplesect kind="note"><para>- To simulate an error, count1 seed value is set as 110000.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>- The values are to be updated if a different PLL frequency is used.</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect2>
